Preserve the bundled OpenSSL API compatibility level with system libraries.
OPENSSL_NO_DEPRECATED otherwise hides the hostname verification functions
used by Boost.Asio with OpenSSL 4.1.

Upstream API compatibility setting: https://github.com/osquery/osquery/pull/8081

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -192,6 +192,10 @@
       NAME OpenSSL
       LINK_LIBRARIES OpenSSL::SSL OpenSSL::Crypto
     )
+    # Match the bundled OpenSSL API level so Boost.Asio can verify hostnames.
+    target_compile_definitions(thirdparty_openssl INTERFACE
+      OPENSSL_API_COMPAT=10101
+    )
     add_system_cmake_dependency(
       NAME Boost
       COMPONENTS filesystem chrono thread context
